  "body": "Motivated vendor, time to act is now!\r\n\r\nDiscover the perfect harmony of modern sophistication and relaxed seaside charm. Located in the heart of Stanmore Bay, Precise on Melia is a thoughtfully curated community designed for those who refuse to compromise on convenience or comfort.\r\n\r\nSelling fast, only 2 left!\r\n\r\nThe Epitome of Modern Functionality Step into a home designed for effortless living. This property offers a beautifully balanced layout featuring:\r\n\r\n3 Spacious Bedrooms & 2 Modern Bathrooms: Including a private master ensuite for your daily retreat.\r\nCulinary Excellence: An open-plan kitchen equipped with premium appliances, boasting a seamless flow that makes hosting a delight.\r\nIndoor-Outdoor Synergy: Light-filled open-plan living and dining areas that transition naturally to your own private garden-perfect for alfresco mornings or evening relaxation.\r\n\r\nConvenience: Complete with a secure single garage.\r\nThe Ultimate Location: Just 7 minutes from Silverdale Shopping Centre and 10 minutes from the motorway. Enjoy the best of both worlds with local cafés, parks, and transport all within an easy stroll.\r\n\r\nCoastal Playground: With Red Beach and Stanmore Bay Beach only minutes away, the ocean is your permanent backdrop.\r\nExclusive Amenities: Elevate your downtime with a private residents' clubhouse and multi-purpose sports court-perfect for fitness and social connection.\r\nEducational Excellence: Secure your children's future with top-tier schooling, from Stanmore Bay School to the prestigious Wentworth College.\r\nStrategic Investment: Positioned just 10 minutes from the future Penlink connection, your commute to Albany and the CBD is set to shrink by 20 minutes, ensuring strong long-term capital growth.\r\n\r\nThis is more than a place to live; it's a place to thrive. Contact our experienced sales team today to secure or explore our other exceptional residences.",
